/E (My name is Justin Smith, and I am a senior Electrical Engineering student at California State University, Northridge, expected to graduate in December 2027. It is an honor to serve as the 2026 to 2027 President of the CSUN Chapter of the National Society of Black Engineers, CSUN NSBE.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (My journey with NSBE has shaped both my academic and professional development. I began as the Diversity and Community Chair, continued as External Vice President, and now have the privilege of leading this organization as President. Through CSUN NSBE, I have found much more than professional resources. I found a community that made me feel supported, motivated, and at home.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
