192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (One of the most impactful experiences for me was attending alumni panels and professional events hosted by CSUN NSBE. Hearing alumni share their journeys, challenges, and accomplishments helped me see that success after college was possible. Their stories gave me renewed motivation and a stronger sense of purpose. As President, I want to keep that torch aflame by creating those same opportunities for current and future Black engineers at CSUN.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
