/P 147 0 R
/E (CSUN NSBE is committed to increasing the number of culturally responsible Black engineers who excel academically, succeed professionally, and positively impact their communities. This year, our priorities include growing our membership, expanding professional development opportunities, and helping more students access transformative experiences through the Fall Regional Conference and NSBE Annual Convention.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
