/E (CSUN NSBE is more than a student organization. It is a support system, a professional network, and a community where students can grow into confident engineers and leaders. Your investment can be life changing for students who may not yet see themselves represented in engineering or may not yet know that a community like NSBE exists to support them.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
