/T (The National Society of Black Engineers \(NSBE\) is a 501\(c\)\(3\) nonprofit organization dedicated to the academic and professional success of Black engineering and technical students and professionals. NSBE offers its members leadership training, professional and academic development, mentoring opportunities, community service outreach programs, and scholarships.  )
/E (The National Society of Black Engineers \(NSBE\) is a 501\(c\)\(3\) nonprofit organization dedicated to the academic and professional success of Black engineering and technical students and professionals. NSBE offers its members leadership training, professional and academic development, mentoring opportunities, community service outreach programs, and scholarships.  )
