<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 151 0 R
/T (Founded in 1977, CSUN-NSBE is the preeminent organization for Black students pursuing STEM degrees at our college. Additionally, CSUN-NSBE is a proud affiliate of Region Six which spans over 13 states and is home to over 30 chapters. With over 15 active members, CSUN-NSBE accounts for about 33 members in total. Through the support of the national organization, the College of Engineering and Computing at our college, and corporate sponsorship, CSUN-NSBE supports Black STEM students by helping them develop socially, academically, and professionally. )
/E (Founded in 1977, CSUN-NSBE is the preeminent organization for Black students pursuing STEM degrees at our college. Additionally, CSUN-NSBE is a proud affiliate of Region Six which spans over 13 states and is home to over 30 chapters. With over 15 active members, CSUN-NSBE accounts for about 33 members in total. Through the support of the national organization, the College of Engineering and Computing at our college, and corporate sponsorship, CSUN-NSBE supports Black STEM students by helping them develop socially, academically, and professionally. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
