/T (The Regional Leadership Conference \(RLC\) is targeted specifically towards Chapter and Professional leadership. Attendees receive three days of position-focused training, professional and leadership development, and an opportunity to network with peers throughout the region. The goal is that leaders leave RLC with the knowledge and tools to be successful as the Model Region and a connection to the NSBE mission. With these new skills, attendees will be able to take their chapters to the next level as they all strive to meet the new regional objectives.)
